# en.desm — sentence bonds for English
#
# One rule per line. A bare line is an abbreviation: a sentence
# may end in it without ending, so the UAX #29 break after it is
# undone. A /regex/ line undoes a break that a match straddles.
# See the syndesmos README for the format.
#
# Seeded from CLDR's sentence-break suppressions
# (common/segments/en.xml, "standard"), Unicode, Inc., under the
# Unicode License (LICENSE-UNICODE). Additions and corrections
# below the seed are this file's own.

